              <caption name="01 — 劇情從二十三年前" lane="1" offset="2/30s" start="0s" duration="46/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">劇情從二十三年前</text></caption>
              <caption name="02 — 四個六年級的同班同學" lane="1" offset="48/30s" start="0s" duration="70/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">四個六年級的
同班同學</text></caption>
              <caption name="03 — 包含竹內涼真飾演的淳一" lane="1" offset="118/30s" start="0s" duration="68/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">包含竹內涼真
飾演的淳一</text></caption>
              <caption name="04 — 以及井上真央飾演的萬季子" lane="1" offset="187/30s" start="0s" duration="79/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">以及井上真央
飾演的萬季子</text></caption>
              <caption name="05 — 他們在學校埋下了那把手槍" lane="1" offset="266/30s" start="0s" duration="93/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">他們在學校
埋下了那把手槍</text></caption>
              <caption name="06 — 槍擊案就此展開" lane="1" offset="359/30s" start="0s" duration="38/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">槍擊案就此展開</text></caption>
              <caption name="07 — 隨後各奔東西" lane="1" offset="397/30s" start="0s" duration="109/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">隨後各奔東西，試圖假裝
一切都沒有發生</text></caption>
              <caption name="08 — 但二十三年後淳一成為了刑警" lane="1" offset="507/30s" start="0s" duration="96/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">但二十三年後
淳一成為了刑警</text></caption>
              <caption name="09 — 他在現場發現了那把手槍" lane="1" offset="604/30s" start="0s" duration="71/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">他在現場發現了
那把手槍</text></caption>
              <caption name="10 — 進而揭開二十三年前槍擊案的真相" lane="1" offset="675/30s" start="0s" duration="108/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">進而揭開二十三年前
槍擊案的真相</text></caption>
              <caption name="11 — 真相終於浮現" lane="1" offset="784/30s" start="0s" duration="98/30s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">二十三年前的槍擊案
真相終於浮現</text></caption>

